##game loading
mm:tips.game.1=Be careful of suspicious looking chests.
mm:tips.game.2=The number of unique Spellbooks is.. over 9000!
mm:tips.game.3=The Reforged Spellcrafter can be recharged using hoppers.
mm:tips.game.5=Sanctuary Keepers will attack anything that has their precious key.
mm:tips.game.6=The Imprison Spell can be used to drain the mana of mobs that cast spells.
mm:tips.game.7=The Quake Spell can only damage mobs that are on the ground.
mm:tips.game.8=On a chance, you might happen upon a meteor shower at nighttime.
mm:tips.game.9=In the Alterrealm, take care to avoid the §c§kRevoid§r.
mm:tips.game.10=Craft an Unobtanium Clock to see how much time you can stay in the Alterrealm.
mm:tips.game.11=In the Alterrealm, casting Spells is impossible.
mm:tips.game.12=Did you know there is a hidden room in the Tower's Hat?
mm:tips.game.13=Vex Spawners.. who thought that was a good idea?
mm:tips.game.14=Craft an Unobtanium Clock to see how much time you can stay in the Alterrealm.
mm:tips.game.15=Most spells can be learned about from the Ancient Texts.
mm:tips.game.16=Scrubels can be tamed by giving them water.
mm:tips.game.17=Waxing a Flickerwick will let it last a little longer.
mm:tips.game.18=You can make lots of Potions with the Booze!
mm:tips.game.19=Slushbucklers LOVE Ice Cream.
mm:tips.game.20=Mymiks and Dyzgises can pilfer items out of your inventory.
mm:tips.game.21=There is a hidden room in the Sanctuary somewhere.. Can you find it?
mm:tips.game.22=Demon armour is extremely powerful, but comes at a price.
mm:tips.game.23=Armour crafted from Azsilva will restore mana when equipped.
mm:tips.game.24=Meteorite Armour lets you unleash powerful crash attacks.
mm:tips.game.26=Craft a Longshot to travel in speed AND style.
mm:tips.game.27=Magnetic Pistons can move any magnetic material like nothing.
mm:tips.game.28=Spells in a Spellbook will gain EXP as you use them.
mm:tips.game.29=Spells from a Staff are always cast at Level III.
mm:tips.game.30=There are over 100 different apperances that a Staff can take.
mm:tips.game.31=You don't want to be caught in the Twisted Woods after sundown.
mm:tips.game.32=Sacred Statues can only be harmed with Pickaxes!
mm:tips.game.33=The Guardian Myth will respawn in its arena a while after it is defeated.

